{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0163","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000000ff:text","row":27075,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"学校に行ってみようと思って、家を出た。","en":"I left the house, thinking I might head over to school.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000013d:text","row":27076,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんがいた。","en":"Youko was there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010487","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00013","en":"Youko-chan was there.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000016f:text","row":27077,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「あれ？」","en":"“Huh?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010488","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00014","en":"Taichi: \"Oh my?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000217:text","row":27078,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「……お、おはよう」","en":"“...G-Good morning.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010489","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00015","en":"Youko: \"...mo-, morning.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000243:text","row":27079,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"ちょっぴり怯えている。","en":"She looked a little frightened.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010490","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00016","en":"Seems to be fairly frightened.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000271:text","row":27080,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"……いじめすぎたかな。","en":"...Maybe I’d picked on her too much.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010491","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00017","en":"...too much teasing perhaps.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000002a7:text","row":27081,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「なにもしないよ、こんな異常事態のさなかに」","en":"“I won’t try anything—not in the middle of all this.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010492","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00018","en":"Taichi: \"I'm not gonna do anything when we're in a situation this abnormal!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000002eb:text","row":27082,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"手招きする。","en":"I beckoned her over.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010493","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00019","en":"I beckon her with the hand,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000030f:text","row":27083,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"微笑み。","en":"I smiled.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010494","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00020","en":"smiling.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000337:text","row":27084,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんなトコいないで、こっちにおいでよ」","en":"“Don’t stand all the way over there. Come here.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010495","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00021","en":"Taichi: \"Don't just stay over there, come over here.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000003d8:text","row":27085,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんは少しほっとして、近寄ってくる。","en":"Youko looked a little relieved and came closer.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010496","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00022","en":"A bit relieved, Youko-chan approaches.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000041a:text","row":27086,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"ほっぺたをつまんだ。","en":"I pinched her cheek.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010497","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00023","en":"I pinch her cheeks.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000005d3:text","row":27087,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00024","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00024","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000005f7:text","row":27088,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"反射的に嫌がらせをしてしまった。","en":"Messing with her had been pure reflex.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010498","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00025","en":"I've ended up harassing her reflexively.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000062f:text","row":27089,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"さすが、表情一つ変えない。","en":"True to form, her expression didn’t change at all.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010499","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00026","en":"Expectably, her expression does not change even one bit.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000661:text","row":27090,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"ポーカーフェイスが、こころなしか呆れているようにも見える。","en":"Though I could almost imagine a trace of exasperation in that poker face.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010500","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00027","en":"Still, her poker faced seemed to be somewhat disgusted.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000006bb:text","row":27091,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「おはよう」","en":"“Good morning.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010501","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00028","en":"Taichi: \"'Morning.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000704:text","row":27092,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「……うそつき」","en":"“...Liar.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010502","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00029","en":"Youko: \"...liar.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000734:text","row":27093,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yep.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010503","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00030","en":"Taichi: \"Yes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000754:text","row":27094,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"正しい。","en":"She wasn’t wrong.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010504","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00031","en":"That's correct.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000077c:text","row":27095,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺はアラベスクだからね」","en":"“That’s me. A regular arabesque.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010505","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00032","en":"Taichi: \"I am Arabesque after all.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000007d3:text","row":27096,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ピカレスク、って言いたいんだと思う」","en":"“...I think you mean picaresque.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010506","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00033","en":"Youko: \"...picaresque is the correct word, I think.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000081d:text","row":27097,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010507","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00034","en":"Taichi: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000008b1:text","row":27098,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"ぐいっ","en":"I gave her cheek a sharp tug.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010508","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00035","en":"Squeeq.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000008f4:text","row":27099,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「いたい」","en":"“Ow.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010509","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00036","en":"Youko: \"Hurts.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000916:text","row":27100,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"表情を変えずに痛がる。","en":"She said it hurt without so much as changing expression.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010510","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00037","en":"Pain complaint without batting an eye.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000094c:text","row":27101,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんな単純なミスをした自分が許せない」","en":"“I can’t forgive myself for making such a basic mistake.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010511","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00038","en":"Taichi: \"A mistake this obvious should be unforgivable for oneself.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000009b1:text","row":27102,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「だったら自分をいじめればいいのに……あ、それいたい、すごく……」","en":"“Then pick on yourself... Oh. That hurts. A lot...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010512","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00039","en":"Youko: \"Then one would best torment oneself... ah, that hurts, plenty...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000a0b:text","row":27103,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"全然痛そうな様子ではない。","en":"She didn’t look the least bit hurt.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010513","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00040","en":"She does not appear to be in a state of pain at all.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000a7a:text","row":27104,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「で、どしたの？」","en":"“So what are you doing here?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010514","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00041","en":"Taichi: \"So, what's it you want?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000aac:text","row":27105,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「こんな昼から姿を見せるなんて珍しい。闇に隠れて生きてるんだと思った」","en":"“You don’t usually show yourself in broad daylight. I thought you lived hidden in the shadows.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010515","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00042","en":"Taichi: \"Showing yourself on this side of midnight is pretty rare. I thought you lived a life hidden in the shadows.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000b90:text","row":27106,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「これ」","en":"“This.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010516","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00043","en":"Youko: \"Here.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000bb0:text","row":27107,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"紙袋。","en":"A paper bag.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010517","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00044","en":"Paper bag.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000bd6:text","row":27108,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「女性用下着？」","en":"“Women’s underwear?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010518","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00045","en":"Taichi: \"Women's underwear?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000c23:text","row":27109,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「いるの？」","en":"“Want some?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010519","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00046","en":"Youko: \"Need some?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000c4f:text","row":27110,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや……どうだろ？」","en":"“Uh... do I?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010520","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00047","en":"Taichi: \"Well... sure, why not?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000c7d:text","row":27111,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"俺という人間は反射的すぎた。","en":"I was entirely too quick on the draw.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010521","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00048","en":"The human known as I was excessively reflexive.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000cd6:text","row":27112,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「部屋のタンスにいくらでも入っているけど」","en":"“I’ve got a whole dresser full in my room.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010522","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00049","en":"Youko: \"But in the dresser of my room there are as many as you may want.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000d20:text","row":27113,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、どうせだったら脱ぎたてでないと……」","en":"“No, if you’re offering, they have to be fresh off you...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010523","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00050","en":"Taichi: \"Well, it's not like they have been freshly stripped off...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000dea:text","row":27114,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「……わかった」","en":"“...All right.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010524","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00051","en":"Youko: \"...understood.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000e12:text","row":27115,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"脱ぎだした。","en":"She began to undress.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010525","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00052","en":"She went to strip hers off.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000e3e:text","row":27116,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「いいって！　いらんがな！」","en":"“Whoa, stop! I don’t actually want them!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010526","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00053","en":"Taichi: \"Really now! I don'wann'em!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000ef8:text","row":27117,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ん」","en":"“...Mm.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010527","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00054","en":"Youko: \"...mh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000f22:text","row":27118,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんなホイホイ脱がれたら、オークションで写真つきで売っちゃいそうだ」","en":"“You peel them off that easily, I might end up auctioning them online with a photo of you attached.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010528","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00055","en":"Taichi: \"If you take them off all blithely blithe, I might just sell them on an auction with picture attached, yes I might.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000fa5:text","row":27119,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「……いやかも」","en":"“...I don’t think I’d like that.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010529","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00056","en":"Youko: \"...not nice, maybe.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00000fd5:text","row":27120,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「四枚のショーツを頭にかぶりつつ自分でも履いて腕輪がわりに両手首にも通して、下着オナニーの饗宴にふけるかもしれぬ」","en":"“I could put one pair on my head, wear one the old-fashioned way, slip the other two over my wrists like bracelets, and indulge in a one-man panty jerk-off bacchanal.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010530","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00057","en":"Taichi: \"And mayhap wear them and in the meantime having four pairs on as hats while fitting just as many on both wrists in the place of bracelets, and thus indulge in a banquet of underwear onanism.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001084:text","row":27121,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「それならいいけど」","en":"“That would be fine.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010531","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00058","en":"Youko: \"But that would be fine.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000010b0:text","row":27122,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"いいのかい。","en":"She was fine with that?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010532","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00059","en":"Fine it would be?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000010d4:text","row":27123,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"しれっと言ったぞ。","en":"She’d said it without batting an eye.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010533","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00060","en":"She said that all nonchalantly she did!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001106:text","row":27124,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「あのねえ……もっとシャンとしようよ。三年生なんだろ」","en":"“Come on... Try to pull yourself together. You’re a third-year.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010534","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00061","en":"Taichi: \"You know, girl... be more dignified. You're a third year are you?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001179:text","row":27125,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「してるもの」","en":"“I have it together.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010535","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00062","en":"Youko: \"I am that.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000011a7:text","row":27126,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「してない。なんかぐんにょりしてる」","en":"“No, you’re not. You’re all limp and floppy.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010536","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00063","en":"Taichi: \"Are being not. You're still sort of a killjoy.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001269:text","row":27127,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「……心外」","en":"“...I resent that.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010537","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00064","en":"Youko: \"...unthinkable.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001313:text","row":27128,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「太一はぽやっとしてる」","en":"“Taichi is spacey.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010538","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00065","en":"Youko: \"Taichi is unfocused.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000134b:text","row":27129,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぽやりたい年ごろなんだ。思春期なんだよ」","en":"“A boy my age needs his space. It’s puberty.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010539","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00066","en":"Taichi: \"I'm of the age of wanting to lose focus you know. I'm adolescent remember!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000138d:text","row":27130,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"と、紙袋の中身を確認する。","en":"I checked the paper bag as I spoke.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010540","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00067","en":"I go ascertain the contents of the paper bag.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000013c7:text","row":27131,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「……サンドイッチ？」","en":"“...Sandwiches?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010541","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00068","en":"Taichi: \"...sandwiches?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000013f5:text","row":27132,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"かなり大量にあった。","en":"There were an awful lot of them.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010542","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00069","en":"And a fairly large amount there was.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001446:text","row":27133,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「生ものは可能な限り保存食にしたので、あまった分で」","en":"“I preserved as much of the perishable food as I could. I made these with what was left.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010543","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00070","en":"Youko: \"The perishables had to be made into preserved food within the limits of the possible, these are with what was left.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000149a:text","row":27134,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「作ったのね」","en":"“You made them.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010544","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00071","en":"Taichi: \"They're handmade then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000014c8:text","row":27135,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「……そうか、人がいないと野菜や果物が」","en":"“...Right. With no people around, the vegetables and fruit will...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010545","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00072","en":"Taichi: \"...right, with no more people then vegetables and fruits...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000152d:text","row":27136,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「当面は。ただ畑や温室をいくつか管理しておくから……二人が生きる程度ならどうということは……」","en":"“For now. But I’ll keep several fields and greenhouses going... Keeping two people alive would be no trouble...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010546","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00073","en":"Youko: \"For the time being. If we only tend to a limited number of fields and greenhouses... the degree of survivability for two people would then be...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000015ab:text","row":27137,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「八人だよ」","en":"“Eight people.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010547","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00074","en":"Taichi: \"There are eight people.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000015cf:text","row":27138,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"指を立てて言う。","en":"I held up a finger.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010548","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00075","en":"So I say with a raised finger.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000015ff:text","row":27139,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「そーいう考え方はよくない。人間が壊れる」","en":"“That’s a bad way to think. It’ll break you.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010549","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00076","en":"Taichi: \"That way of thinking is not good. It will break your character as a human.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001649:text","row":27140,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺たち、まっとうに生きるって決めただろ？」","en":"“We decided we were going to live like decent human beings, remember?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010550","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00077","en":"Taichi: \"We decided to live respectably, right?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001713:text","row":27141,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「……うん」","en":"“...Yes.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010551","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00078","en":"Youko: \"...yes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001737:text","row":27142,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"素直にうなずきはするけれど。","en":"She nodded obediently enough, but—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010552","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00079","en":"There is an obedient nod, however,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000176b:text","row":27143,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"結局、俺の言うことをそのまま機械的に実行するだけなんだよな。","en":"in the end, she was still only following my instructions to the letter, like a machine.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010553","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00080","en":"in the end this is nothing more than continuing to mechanically carry out what I said, without change.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000017bf:text","row":27144,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"どうも癪(しゃく)だ。","en":"That rubbed me the wrong way.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010554","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00081","en":"Quite the cause of offense.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000017f3:text","row":27145,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"「ありがとう。もらっておくよ。ちょっと量が多すぎる気がするけど」","en":"“Thanks. I’ll take them. Feels like way too many, though.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010555","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00082","en":"Taichi: \"Thank you. I'll be graciously taking this. Sure seems that there's an awful lot of them, though.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001853:text","row":27146,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00083","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00083","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001877:text","row":27147,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"顔面筋肉が（指の下で）少し動いた気がする。","en":"I thought I felt one of her facial muscles twitch beneath my fingers.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00084","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00084","en":"I notice that her facial muscles (underfinger) move just slightly.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000018c1:text","row":27148,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"「まるで二人分あるかのような量だね」","en":"“It’s almost like there’s enough here for two people.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00085","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00085","en":"Taichi: \"Almost as if this amount were intended for two.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001905:text","row":27149,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00086","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00086","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001929:text","row":27150,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"顔面筋肉が（指の下で）少し動いた気がする。","en":"I thought I felt one of her facial muscles twitch beneath my fingers.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00087","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00087","en":"I notice that her facial muscles (underfinger) move just slightly.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:0000196b:text","row":27151,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"触れていなければ、その微細な表情変化はとても読み取れない。","en":"If I hadn’t been touching her, I never would have caught such a tiny shift in her expression.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010556","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00088","en":"If I weren't touching her, I would never catch those microscopic changes in facial expression.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000019c5:text","row":27152,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010557","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00089","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:000019ed:text","row":27153,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"「まるで二人分あるかのような量だね」","en":"“It’s almost like there’s enough here for two people.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00090","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00090","en":"Taichi: \"Almost as if this amount were intended for two.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001a29:text","row":27154,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"もう一度言ってみた。","en":"I said it again.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010558","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00091","en":"I tried saying it one more time.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001a5d:text","row":27155,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00092","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00092","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001a81:text","row":27156,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"顔面筋肉が（指の下で）少し動いた気がする。","en":"I thought I felt one of her facial muscles twitch beneath my fingers.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00093","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00093","en":"I notice that her facial muscles (underfinger) move just slightly.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001ac3:text","row":27157,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"ははーん。","en":"Aha.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010559","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00094","en":"Ah-huh.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001ae5:text","row":27158,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"邪悪な考え。","en":"A wicked thought.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010560","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00095","en":"Wicked thoughts.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001b11:text","row":27159,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"「この二人分のサンドイッチ……これを俺は是非……」","en":"“These sandwiches for two... I think I’d really like to...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:010561","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0003a:00096","en":"Taichi: \"These sandwiches for two... most certainly, I will...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001b83:choice:01","row":27160,"ordinal":86,"kind":"choice","jp":"一人で食う","en":"Eat them all myself.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0163:00001b83:choice:02","row":27161,"ordinal":87,"kind":"choice","jp":"誰か他の人と食う","en":"Eat them with someone else.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]}]}
